    "detailed_description": "Shark Party is a unique multiplayer party game focus on collecting Shark Coins and donate it to Shark King to gain its reputation. <br>Players can play as single player or team with friends. You can choose from more than 10 different characters, each of them has special ability in terms of movement ability or battle ability.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore more than 8 maps</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027630/extras/a750e0c7ff8258de8b5030f41b846f03.avif?t=1723432322\" width=600 height=334 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027630/extras/8b58e76cacd7e6e44e9119591f487089.poster.avif?t=1723432322\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027630/extras/8b58e76cacd7e6e44e9119591f487089.webm?t=1723432322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027630/extras/8b58e76cacd7e6e44e9119591f487089.mp4?t=1723432322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mount a dragon to spit fireball and fly high!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027630/extras/cb07ae182a92cf8dbc0ced7316f584b7.poster.avif?t=1723432322\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027630/extras/cb07ae182a92cf8dbc0ced7316f584b7.webm?t=1723432322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027630/extras/cb07ae182a92cf8dbc0ced7316f584b7.mp4?t=1723432322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><stron